; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - best trailing of M5 (tick replay): Candles trailing (TrailMode 6), setup 2 of 3: both, session 0700-2000 server time, trend filter D1 EMA 50, target 1.5R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
